  "record": {
   "title": "AIP-01 · Meet Aiphin: one team, every expert",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-01] Meet Aiphin: one team, every expert\nReel 9:16 · 25 s · Brand intro · Top (awareness) · 2026-11-16\n\nObjective:\nIntroduce the agency and the mascot. In one reel the viewer learns the name (AY-fin), the positioning 'One team. Every expert.' and the four services we lead with: custom CRM, AI implementation and integration, smart websites, social content.\n\nHook (EN):\nHi, I'm Aiphin. Your AI teammate.\n\nHook (AR):\nمرحبًا، أنا أيفِن. زميلك في الذكاء الاصطناعي.\n\nScene plan:\n0–2 s  Aiphin waves on the Ocean glow background, hook pops in.\n2–6 s  'Most agencies sell the advice or the build. We do both.'\n6–18 s  Four quick cards, one per service, each with one concrete line: Custom CRM ('built around how you sell'), AI integration ('the WhatsApp answered at 9pm'), Smart website ('answers questions at 2am'), Social content ('one voice all month, AR + EN').\n18–22 s  Contrast line: 'We don't sell you a roadmap. We build it and run it.'\n22–25 s  End card: stacked lockup, WhatsApp +961 71 313 917, aiphin.me.\nVisuals: Aiphin waving (new pose), Aiphin pointing at the service cards (new pose). Voice-over in the cloned Aiphin voice.\n\nCaption:\nMost agencies sell you either the advice or the build. A roadmap nobody implements and a system nobody planned fail the same way.\n\nWe're Aiphin: one team for custom CRMs, AI integrations, smart websites and social content. We build what we recommend, and we stay to run it.\n\nTell us what's slowing you down.\n\nHashtags:\n#Aiphin #AIagency #MENA #Beirut #Automation #CustomCRM #SmartWebsite\n\nCTA:\nMessage us on WhatsApp +961 71 313 917 · aiphin.me",
