   "title": "AIP-02 · 5 signs you've outgrown your CRM",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-02] 5 signs you've outgrown your CRM\nCarousel 4:5 · 7 slides · Custom CRM · Middle (consideration) · 2026-11-18\n\nObjective:\nMake distributors, project and tender businesses recognise that an off-the-shelf CRM or a spreadsheet is forcing them to change how they sell, and that a custom CRM fits the pipeline instead.\n\nHook (EN):\nYour CRM shouldn't change how you sell.\n\nHook (AR):\nنظام الـ CRM لا يجب أن يغيّر طريقة بيعك.\n\nScene plan:\nS1 Hook on Night background, Aiphin thinking pose.\nS2 Sign 1: sales lives in a spreadsheet the CRM never sees.\nS3 Sign 2: quotes and approvals happen in WhatsApp, not in the system.\nS4 Sign 3: you pay for 40 features and use 4.\nS5 Sign 4: nobody trusts the pipeline numbers on Monday.\nS6 Sign 5: every new step means a workaround.\nS7 The fix: a CRM built around your pipeline (pipelines, quotes and approvals, roles and audit trail, WhatsApp and email threading, migration from spreadsheets or HubSpot). CTA.\nVisuals: one generic CRM pipeline mockup (no real client data), Aiphin thinking.\n\nCaption:\nDistributors, projects, tenders, service contracts: some pipelines are genuinely different. When the tool doesn't fit, people stop using it, and the real pipeline goes back to Excel and WhatsApp.\n\nWe build CRMs around how you already sell: your stages, your quotes and approvals, your WhatsApp threads, with your spreadsheets or HubSpot data moved over.\n\nHow many of the five do you recognise?\n\nHashtags:\n#CustomCRM #SalesPipeline #Aiphin #B2B #MENA\n\nCTA:\nSend to a consultant on WhatsApp +961 71 313 917",
   "input_source": "csv",
   "source_reference": "research/out/aiphin_plan_01.json (Aiphin launch ideas, round 1) › Content › AIP-02",
   "content_type": "carousel",
