   "title": "AIP-03 · Leads at 9pm. Replies at 9:01pm.",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-03] Leads at 9pm. Replies at 9:01pm.\nReel 9:16 · 20 s · AI implementation & integration · Middle (consideration) · 2026-11-20\n\nObjective:\nShow the before/after of an AI assistant on WhatsApp: the lead that used to wait until 11am now gets an answer in a minute, and a human takes over with the full context.\n\nHook (EN):\nLead at 9pm. Reply at 11am. Too late.\n\nHook (AR):\nعميل في التاسعة مساءً. ردّ في الحادية عشرة صباحًا. متأخر جدًا.\n\nScene plan:\n0–3 s  BEFORE: phone at night, message arrives 21:04, clock spins to 11:00, the customer replies 'Already booked elsewhere'.\n3–5 s  Split wipe to AFTER.\n5–13 s  Same message at 21:04, the assistant replies at 21:05 with price range and two questions, books a call.\n13–17 s  Next morning: the sales rep opens the thread with the full context ('human handoff with full context').\n17–20 s  '24/7 on chat, WhatsApp, email and voice.' End card.\nVisuals: animated generic chat UI built in HTML (no real app logos), Aiphin holding a smartphone (new pose) for the end card.\n\nCaption:\nLeads arrive at 9pm and get a reply at 11am the next day, by which time they've booked elsewhere.\n\nWe connect an AI assistant to your WhatsApp, web chat and Instagram. It answers the routine questions in a minute, qualifies the lead, and hands your team the conversation with full context in the morning.\n\nLeads at 9pm. Replies at 9:01pm.\n\nHashtags:\n#WhatsAppBusiness #Chatbot #AIintegration #Aiphin #LeadResponse\n\nCTA:\nChat with Aiphin on WhatsApp +961 71 313 917",
