   "title": "AIP-04 · Nobody wakes up wanting AI",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-04] Nobody wakes up wanting AI\nStatic post 4:5 · 1 image · Point of view · Top (awareness) · 2026-11-23\n\nObjective:\nA shareable point-of-view card that sets the tone: we lead with the business problem, not the technology. Builds trust with owners tired of AI hype.\n\nHook (EN):\nNobody wakes up wanting AI.\n\nHook (AR):\nلا أحد يستيقظ صباحًا وهو يريد ذكاءً اصطناعيًا.\n\nScene plan:\nNight background, headline in Audiowide, Glow on the word 'AI' only.\nSupport line: 'They want the WhatsApp answered, the quote out before lunch, and the stock number to be right.'\nSmall Aiphin, calm pose, bottom corner facing the text. Footer aiphin.me.\nVisuals: Aiphin calm smile on dark background with cyan halo (new pose).\n\nCaption:\nNobody wakes up wanting AI. They want the WhatsApp answered, the quote out before lunch, and the stock number to be right.\n\nThat's where we start: with the problem. AI is only the means. And if automation isn't the answer, we say so.\n\nHashtags:\n#Aiphin #AI #SmallBusiness #MENA #Automation\n\nCTA:\nTell us what's slowing you down · aiphin.me",
