   "title": "AIP-05 · What your website does at 2am",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-05] What your website does at 2am\nCarousel 4:5 · 6 slides · Smart website · Middle (consideration) · 2026-11-25\n\nObjective:\nExplain the difference between a brochure website and a smart one: a site that answers, captures and tracks while the team sleeps, in Arabic and English.\n\nHook (EN):\nIt's 2am. Is your website working?\n\nHook (AR):\nالساعة الثانية فجرًا. هل موقعك يعمل؟\n\nScene plan:\nS1 Hook, night city skyline with a glowing laptop.\nS2 02:00 a visitor asks a question: the built-in assistant answers.\nS3 02:03 the visitor leaves a number: lead captured and sent to the CRM.\nS4 02:05 switches to Arabic: the site is RTL-ready, same experience.\nS5 09:00 the team sees where the lead came from (analytics and conversion tracking).\nS6 'A website that ranks and answers questions at 2am.' CTA.\nVisuals: night skyline scene with laptop (new image), generic website mockup EN + AR built in HTML.\n\nCaption:\nMost websites are brochures: they look nice and wait. A smart website keeps working after you close.\n\nWe build fast sites with the assistant and the tracking built into the page, not bolted on: answers at 2am, leads straight into your CRM, Arabic and English from day one.\n\nHashtags:\n#SmartWebsite #WebDesign #Aiphin #LeadCapture #ArabicWebsite\n\nCTA:\nSee what we build · aiphin.me",
