   "title": "AIP-07 · How we work: diagnose before we quote",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-07] How we work: diagnose before we quote\nCarousel 4:5 · 6 slides · Process + trust · Bottom (decision) · 2026-11-30\n\nObjective:\nLower the risk of the first step. Show the four-step method and that the client keeps the written diagnostic whatever they decide, with one live workflow in about six weeks.\n\nHook (EN):\nWe don't quote before we diagnose.\n\nHook (AR):\nلا نقدّم عرض سعر قبل أن نشخّص المشكلة.\n\nScene plan:\nS1 Hook + Aiphin pointing.\nS2 Diagnose: we sit with the work, count the steps, tools and waiting.\nS3 Quantify: a monthly cost on each bottleneck, so numbers set the priorities.\nS4 Design: the smallest fix (an integration, a bot, or deleting a step).\nS5 Prove: one real workflow live before a bigger programme. '6 weeks, typical time from diagnosis to first live workflow.'\nS6 'The written diagnostic is yours to keep, whatever you decide.' CTA.\nVisuals: Aiphin pointing to the side (new pose); step icons built in HTML.\n\nCaption:\nBefore we build anything, we sit with your team and find where money and hours leak. You get a written diagnosis with a ranked, costed list, not a sales deck. It's yours to keep, whatever you decide.\n\nThen we ship one real workflow live, so you judge output, not a Gantt chart.\n\nHashtags:\n#BusinessDiagnostic #Consulting #Aiphin #Automation #MENA\n\nCTA:\nStart with a business diagnostic · WhatsApp +961 71 313 917",
   "input_source": "csv",
   "source_reference": "research/out/aiphin_plan_01.json (Aiphin launch ideas, round 1) › Content › AIP-07",
