   "title": "AIP-08 · We built our own product first: Stacko",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-08] We built our own product first: Stacko\nReel 9:16 · 25 s · Proof: we build · Middle (consideration) · 2026-12-02\n\nObjective:\nProve 'we build what we recommend' with something real: Stacko, the AI stock-management product Aiphin built. Shows build capability (CRM-style app, Telegram/WhatsApp-first input, live dashboards) without inventing client results.\n\nHook (EN):\nAn agency that builds its own products.\n\nHook (AR):\nوكالة تبني منتجاتها بنفسها.\n\nScene plan:\n0–3 s  Hook over Aiphin on Night background.\n3–8 s  'The stock number should be right. So we built Stacko.' Stacko logo appears (Stacko brand assets).\n8–18 s  Quick cuts of real Stacko screens inside a phone and a laptop frame: message in, stock updates, live warehouse map.\n18–22 s  'The same team builds your CRM, your integrations and your website.'\n22–25 s  End card: 'Stacko, a product by AIPHIN' then the Aiphin lockup + WhatsApp.\nVisuals: existing Stacko screenshots from the visual library (UI frames), Aiphin typing on a holographic screen (new pose).\n\nCaption:\nWe say we build what we recommend. Here's the proof: Stacko, the stock-management product our team designed, built and runs.\n\nSame people, same method, for your CRM, your integrations and your website.\n\nHashtags:\n#Stacko #Aiphin #ProductStudio #Inventory #BuiltInBeirut\n\nCTA:\nSee what we build · aiphin.me",
