   "title": "AIP-10 · Who makes this content?",
   "original_idea": "[AIP-10] Who makes this content?\nReel 9:16 · 25 s · Social content · Middle (consideration) · 2026-12-07\n\nObjective:\nSell the social content service with a behind-the-scenes look at our own content system: idea, script, design, approval, publish, in Arabic and English, one voice all month.\n\nHook (EN):\nThis reel went through 5 steps before you saw it.\n\nHook (AR):\nهذا الفيديو مرّ بخمس مراحل قبل أن يصلك.\n\nScene plan:\n0–2 s  Hook.\n2–18 s  Five quick steps on a board, each card flipping to the next: Idea (from the monthly plan) → Script (EN + AR, written natively) → Design (carousels and reels in brand) → Approval (the client approves every piece) → Publish (scheduled, then a performance review).\n18–22 s  'Deciding what's worth posting is the hard part. We do that part too.'\n22–25 s  End card.\nVisuals: generic content board / pipeline UI built in HTML (no client names), Aiphin celebrating (new pose).\n\nCaption:\nPosting isn't the hard part. Deciding what's worth posting is.\n\nWe run your calendar end to end: a monthly plan by topic, carousels, reel scripts and captions written natively in Arabic and English, your approval on every piece, then a review of what worked. One voice, all month.\n\nHashtags:\n#SocialMediaMarketing #ContentCreation #Aiphin #ArabicContent #MENA\n\nCTA:\nStart a project · WhatsApp +961 71 313 917",
